Kavemouth place maps
====================

Copyright B4mad Technologies and Spellkave contributors.

These images are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Suggested credit: "Spellkave art, CC BY 4.0".

Backdrop maps for the Kavemouth places and the floor-plan pictures in
`plans/` they were made from. They are original Spellkave material. The
plans are drawn by `scripts/build-map-inputs.ts` from
`author/lib/layouts.ts`. The maps were generated with PixelLab
(https://www.pixellab.ai) over those plans. The `.json` sidecar next to
each map records the tool, the full request with its prompt, the plan it
started from, the time and the SHA-256 of the image bytes.

Some images were generated with PixelLab. PixelLab's terms restrict using its outputs to train other models; that restriction may apply to you.
